{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"申命記","commonName":"申命記","title":"申命記","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"4a98ab64316df301207d28935cf308fe8032792737350a017363e19134af391f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":951},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"諸天哪，側耳，我要說話；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願地也聽我口中的言語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的教訓要淋漓如雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的言語要滴落如露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如細雨降在嫩草上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如甘霖降在菜蔬中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要宣告耶和華的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要將大德歸與我們的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他是磐石，他的作為完全；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所行的無不公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是誠實無偽的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又公義，又正直。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這乖僻彎曲的世代向他行事邪僻；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有這弊病就不是他的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧無知的民哪，你們這樣報答耶和華嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他豈不是你的父、將你買來的嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他是製造你、建立你的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你當追想上古之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"思念歷代之年；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"問你的父親，他必指示你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"問你的長者，他必告訴你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至高者將地業賜給列邦，將世人分開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就照以色列人的數目立定萬民的疆界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的分本是他的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的產業本是雅各。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和華遇見他在曠野－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒涼野獸吼叫之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就環繞他，看顧他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保護他，如同保護眼中的瞳人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如鷹攪動巢窩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在雛鷹以上兩翅搧展，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接取雛鷹，背在兩翼之上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，耶和華獨自引導他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並無外邦神與他同在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華使他乘駕地的高處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得吃田間的土產；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又使他從磐石中咂蜜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從堅石中吸油；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也吃牛的奶油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊的奶，羊羔的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊所出的公綿羊和山羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與上好的麥子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也喝葡萄汁釀的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"但耶書崙漸漸肥胖，粗壯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光潤，踢跳，奔跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便離棄造他的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"輕看救他的磐石；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬拜別神，觸動上帝的憤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行可憎惡的事，惹了他的怒氣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所祭祀的鬼魔並非真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是素不認識的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是近來新興的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你列祖所不畏懼的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你輕忽生你的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘記產你的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華看見他的兒女惹動他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就厭惡他們，說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向他們掩面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看他們的結局如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們本是極乖僻的族類，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中無誠實的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們以那「不算為神」的觸動我的憤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以虛無的神惹了我的怒氣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要以那「不成子民」的觸動他們的憤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以愚昧的國民惹了他們的怒氣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為在我怒中有火燒起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直燒到極深的陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把地和地的出產盡都焚燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山的根基也燒着了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"我要將禍患堆在他們身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的箭向他們射盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必因飢餓消瘦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被炎熱苦毒吞滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打發野獸用牙齒咬他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並土中腹行的，用毒氣害他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外頭有刀劍，內室有驚恐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人喪亡，使少男、童女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃奶的、白髮的，盡都滅絕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說，我必將他們分散遠方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們的名號從人間除滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟恐仇敵惹動我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只怕敵人錯看，說：是我們手的能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並非耶和華所行的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"因為以色列民毫無計謀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中沒有聰明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟願他們有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能明白這事，肯思念他們的結局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是他們的磐石賣了他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是耶和華交出他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一人焉能追趕他們千人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人焉能使萬人逃跑呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"據我們的仇敵自己斷定，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的磐石不如我們的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的葡萄樹是所多瑪的葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛾摩拉田園所生的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的葡萄是毒葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全掛都是苦的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的酒是大蛇的毒氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是虺蛇殘害的惡毒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"這不都是積蓄在我這裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封鎖在我府庫中嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們失腳的時候，伸冤報應在我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他們遭災的日子近了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那要臨在他們身上的必速速來到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華見他百姓毫無能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無論困住的、自由的都沒有剩下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必為他們伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為他的僕人後悔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必說：他們的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們所投靠的磐石，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是向來吃他們祭牲的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝他們奠祭之酒的，在哪裏呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他可以興起幫助你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"護衛你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"text":"你們如今要知道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我，惟有我是上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以外並無別神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使人死，我使人活；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我損傷，我也醫治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並無人能從我手中救出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向天舉手說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我憑我的永生起誓：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若磨我閃亮的刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手掌審判之權，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必報復我的敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應恨我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的箭飲血飲醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是被殺被擄之人的血。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的刀要吃肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是仇敵中首領之頭的肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"text":"你們外邦人當與主的百姓一同歡呼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他要伸他僕人流血的冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應他的敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"潔淨他的地，救贖他的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":["摩西和嫩的兒子約書亞去將這歌的一切話說給百姓聽。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的最後訓言"]},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":["摩西向以色列眾人說完了這一切的話，"]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":["又說：「我今日所警教你們的，你們都要放在心上；要吩咐你們的子孫謹守遵行這律法上的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":["因為這不是虛空、與你們無關的事，乃是你們的生命；在你們過約旦河要得為業的地上必因這事日子得以長久。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":["當日，耶和華吩咐摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":["「你上這亞巴琳山中的尼波山去，在摩押地與耶利哥相對，觀看我所要賜給以色列人為業的迦南地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":["你必死在你所登的山上，歸你列祖",{"noteId":8},"去，像你哥哥亞倫死在何珥山上，歸他的列祖一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":["因為你們在尋的曠野，加低斯的米利巴水，在以色列人中沒有尊我為聖，得罪了我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":["我所賜給以色列人的地，你可以遠遠地觀看，卻不得進去。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"原文是本民","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":50}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/DEU/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":52}